Z||000008||My7Fieros||04-21-2001||12:45 AM||||Hmmmm....well, glad to hear your Fiero is kicking a$$....however, Im hoping that the turbo makes a major diff..it must. Ive got a brand new Mustang, and my roommate has a 98 Gt conv 5 spd. Dont get me wrong, you know how much I love Fieros, but, that Mustang is <B><I>FAST</B></I>...weve raced before (he has Fieros as well)..he was in his Mustang, and I was in my 86 Gt....um, well, I hung w/ him briefly, but not long...it really wasnt close. Like 'em or not, 'Stangers are <I>very</I> fast. Of course my Fiero is stock, no turbo.||||reg||1
